00:00:14.059 --> 00:00:20.090
Their behavior is putting people at risk and
it will cause people to die unnecessarily.

00:00:20.090 --> 00:00:21.420
People who didn't need to die.

00:00:21.420 --> 00:00:22.420
Now, I'm.

00:00:22.420 --> 00:00:24.560
