systems, the deficits in our health care system,

00:01:11.210 --> 00:01:16.340
in our economy, in our president's capacity
to deal with a crisis, a total lack of capacity,

00:01:16.340 --> 00:01:17.340
that is.

00:01:17.340 --> 00:01:21.650
But we're also hurting because of bad and
dumb people.

